(Slide 1: Problem Formulation) '
(- 23M Stack Overflow questions with frequent duplicate inquiries.) '
(- Exact pairwise comparison across 2.2M questions requires 2.42 trillion checks.) '
(- Goal: Sub-quadratic candidate generation with bounded recall loss.) '
ET
