(Slide 2: Big Data 5 Vs & Streaming ETL) '
(- 68.9 GB compressed XML archive; 2.2M Python questions.) '
(- Zero-disk streaming decompression \(7z x -so\) directly into Parquet.) '
(- Clean separation of posts_meta, posts_text, and post_links.) '
ET
