(Slide 5: Distributed Similarity Pipeline Architecture) '
(- C1 \(Text\) -> C2 \(Shingles\) -> C3 \(Signatures\) -> C4 \(Candidates\).) '
(- 100% custom MapReduce-style implementation using Spark SQL and mapPartitions.) '
(- No Python row-by-row UDF bottlenecks.) '
ET
endstream
