(Slide 6: Shingling & Text Preprocessing \(E1\)) '
(- Strips HTML while preserving programming syntax.) '
(- Isolates <code> and <pre> tags into dedicated code_shingles stream.) '
(- Word 2-grams \(k=2\) separates duplicates best; drop_common_share=0.05 prunes boilerplate.) '
ET
endstream
