(Slide 7: MinHash Signatures from Scratch \(E2\)) '
(- Modular universal linear hashing: h\(x\) = \(a*x + b\) mod 2,147,483,647.) '
(- Tested signature lengths 32 to 256; n=128 selected \(error < 0.044 at s=0.5\).) '
(- Prefix stability: shorter signatures are exact prefixes of longer ones.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
