(Slide 8: LSH Banding & S-Curves: Theory vs. Measurement \(E3\)) '
(- Cuts n=128 signature into b bands of r rows \(b * r = 128\).) '
(- Evaluated b=16,r=8; b=32,r=4; b=64,r=2.) '
(- Selected b=32, r=4 \(threshold ~0.420\): >87% recall at s>=0.5 with high pruning.) '
ET
endstream
