(Slide 9: Big-Bucket Skew & Size-Limit Policy \(E7\)) '
(- Common programming terms cause massive bucket skew \(>10,000 posts\).) '
(- size_limit\(1000\) policy drops oversized buckets and logs events.) '
(- Pruning top 0.02% largest buckets eliminated 94% candidate explosion with <0.8% recall loss.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
