(Slide 10: Topic Partitioning & Tag Blocking \(E6\)) '
(- Questions in disjoint technologies never duplicate each other.) '
(- Tag blocking partitions bucket hash spaces by SON frequent tag itemsets.) '
(- Reduces comparisons by 3.4x while maintaining 98.1% Recall@10.) '
ET
endstream
