(Slide 13: Baseline Comparison: Ours vs. Exact & Spark MLlib \(E5\)) '
(- Exact search fails beyond 50k questions \(O\(N^2\) quadratic wall\).) '
(- Spark MinHashLSH only supports OR-only table hashing \(high false positives\).) '
(- DupHunter is 2.3x faster with 4.1x fewer candidates at equivalent recall.) '
ET
endstream
